# OpenVLC build artifacts and generated output (never commit these)

# Archives / dumps at the openvlc root only (e.g. the old 37 MB stm32.zip).
# NOTE: this is intentionally NOT a global *.zip — the hardware/ fabrication
# packages (Gerber/NC-drill .zip per PCB revision) ARE tracked.
/*.zip

# STM32 CubeIDE generated output
stm32-rx/STM32CubeIDE/Debug/
stm32-rx/STM32CubeIDE/Release/

# STM32 host-test build tree (CMake)
stm32-rx/firmware/build-host/
stm32-rx/firmware/build/

# Python caches (raspberry-gateway tools)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Kernel-module / PRU build leftovers (BeagleBone)
*.o
*.ko
*.mod.c
*.mod
.*.cmd
Module.symvers
Module.markers
modules.order
.tmp_versions/

# Altium working artifacts (hardware/) - regenerated locally, keep out of git
# if the original PCB folders are ever re-synced over the tree.
hardware/**/History/
hardware/**/__Previews/
hardware/**/Project Logs for */
hardware/**/Project Outputs for */
*.PrjPcbStructure
*.SchDocPreview
*.PcbDocPreview
